    seoTitle: "How Blue Tea Made WhatsApp AI Its Biggest Sales Channel · YourLio AI",
    seoDescription: "WhatsApp overtook the website as Blue Tea's largest conversational channel, and a third of all sessions start a chat. See how over 25,000 chats were handled across three channels.",
    date: "September 8, 2026",
