    title: "Sylvi Watches runs discovery, warranty and repair through one memory",
    tagline: "Budget-led spec questions and a service tail that never ends",
    seoTitle: "How Sylvi Watches Runs Four Channels on One Customer Memory · YourLio AI",
    seoDescription: "A watch is a considered purchase with a long service tail. See how Sylvi ran over 6,000 chats across four channels, handled 291 repair and warranty enquiries, and kept one customer memory.",
    date: "September 8, 2026",
    updated: "2026-09-08",
