    answer: "RippedUp Nutrition, an Indian sports-nutrition brand on Shopify, runs YourLio AI on its Website Agent and Instagram AI. Between 1 June and 7 September 2026 the agent handled over 7,000 chats (30.5% of them on Instagram) and resolved 90.53% with no human handoff, matching goals to product stacks across a wide range of formats and sizes.",
    stats: [{"value":"30.5%","display":"31%","label":"of chats arrived through Instagram"},{"value":"18.6%","display":"19%","label":"higher order value than a store average order, August 2026"},{"value":"19.4%","display":"19%","label":"of chats ended in an order, August 2026"}],
