    answer: "YourSpex, the D2C eyewear brand from GKB Eyecare, runs YourLio AI across WhatsApp AI, its Website Agent and Instagram AI. Between 1 July and 7 September 2026 the agent handled over 6,500 chats (73.8% on WhatsApp) with 41.68% of sessions starting a chat and 95.47% resolved without a human. 718 of those chats concerned home eye test bookings.",
