    seoTitle: "How Cureayu Answers Safety Questions at Scale on WhatsApp AI · YourLio AI",
    seoDescription: "In condition-led ayurveda the first question is whether it's safe, not what it costs. See how Cureayu ran 63% of chats on WhatsApp and resolved 92.4% without a human.",
    date: "September 8, 2026",
