    answer: "Ashba Botanics, an Indian curly-haircare brand on Shopify, runs YourLio AI as its Website Agent. Across 46 days from 24 July 2026 the agent handled several hundred chats, resolved 95.8% of them with no human handoff (the highest rate among the ten brands documented here) and completed 99 guided curl-type quizzes. Two thirds of chats referenced a specific product.",
    stats: [{"value":"95.8%","display":"96%","label":"resolved without a human handoff"},{"value":"18.4%","display":"18%","label":"of visitors engaged the agent"},{"value":"66.0%","display":"66%","label":"mentioned a specific product"}],
    features: [{"name":"Website Agent","description":"The single channel. Carries a chat in a category with its own technical vocabulary."},{"name":"AI Sales Chat","description":"Trained on the brand's own voice, ingredient philosophy and curl-type guidance rather than generic haircare copy."},{"name":"AI Quiz and Discovery","description":"Guided curl-type matching for shoppers who can describe their hair but cannot name a product."},{"name":"Nudge Engine","description":"Product-aware prompts on a catalog where every item is part of a routine, not a standalone purchase."}],
