    seoTitle: "How Bake Cosmetics Answers 94% of Skincare Questions Without a Human · YourLio AI",
    seoDescription: "Shoppers arrive describing a concern, not naming a product. See how Bake Cosmetics resolved 94.06% of several hundred chats without a human handoff across 46 days.",
    date: "December 10, 2025",
