    faqs: [{"question":"How do you sell a product category shoppers have never bought?","answer":"By teaching it first. Nysh is the only brand documented here where Product Discovery outranks Product Info, 376 chats. Shoppers have to understand what an air-activated warmer is before they can choose a pack size."},{"question":"What resolution rate did Nysh reach?","answer":"94.67% of several hundred chats were resolved with no human handoff across 46 days, one of the highest rates among the brands documented here."},{"question":"When should a brand use a guided quiz?","answer":"When the catalog structure is not navigable by a first-time buyer. Nysh's catalog is organised by body area and pack size, which means nothing to someone who has not yet worked out which body area applies to their problem."},{"question":"What limits an AI agent's performance most often?","answer":"The knowledge base, not the model. Three of Nysh's four recorded shopper objections were about daily-use safety and heat duration the agent could not confirm, content that does not exist on the site rather than reasoning the agent got wrong."},{"question":"What channels does Nysh run YourLio AI on?","answer":"Three: the Website Agent as the primary surface, plus Instagram AI and WhatsApp AI. The two secondary channels are early in their rollout in this window."}],
